# Local eval datasets & generated artifacts (not deployed)
# Note: data/* not data/ - excluding the directory itself stops git descending
# into it, which would make the negation below a no-op.
data/*
# ...except the odds-snapshot series. Odds drift can only be captured going
# forward and never re-collected, so it lives in git rather than on one disk.
!data/odds-snapshots.jsonl
reports/
*.readable.txt

